                            color: cs.onSurface,
                            fontSize: 13,
                            fontWeight: FontWeight.w700,
                          ),
                        ),
                        Text(
                          timeago.format(comment.createdAt, locale: 'ko'),
                          style: TextStyle(
                            color: cs.onSurface.withValues(alpha: 0.3),
